Package: fastMILC
Type: Package
Title: Fast Vectorized MIcrosimulation Lung Cancer (MILC) Model
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stavroula A.", "Chrysanthopoulou", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original MILC model and archival implementation"),
    person("Thomas A.", "Trikalinos", email = "ttrikalin@mac.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A vectorized re-implementation of the continuous-time
    microsimulation lung cancer natural-history model MILC. Event times are
    sampled with the 'nhppp' non-homogeneous Poisson point process samplers over
    a 'data.table' population, replacing the per-individual scalar sampling of
    the archival MILC package. The model describes malignancy onset, tumor
    progression and stage at diagnosis, and death from lung cancer and from
    other causes.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
